y tracks captured pieces for both sides in real time and calculates the material differential score (e.g. `White +3`). |\n| **9** | **Game Results** | The engine and rule validator detect **Check**, **Checkmate**, **Stalemate**, **Threefold Repetition**, **50-Move Rule**, **Insufficient Material**, **Timeout**, and **Resignation** with dedicated visual banners. |\n| **10** | **Pawn Promotion** | Advance a pawn to the opposite rank. A promotion dialog will appear allowing you to select **Queen**, **Rook**, **Bishop**, or **Knight** before the move is finalized. |\n\n---\n\nFeel free to try out the moves in your browser. Let me know if you would like any further adjustments, customizations, or additional features!","thinking":"The system message indicates user takeover of the browser at `http://localhost:5173`, specifically within `agent-tab-1`. The user initiated this takeover by pressing \"Stop,\" effectively halting the browser subagent. This signals a pause in automated browser interactions, awaiting further user input.\n\n\n"}
